msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "Perilaku"

msgid "Face authentication"
msgstr "Autentikasi wajah"

msgid "Enable face authentication (lock screen)"
msgstr "Aktifkan autentikasi wajah (layar kunci)"

msgid "Face retry mode"
msgstr "Mode percobaan ulang wajah"

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Dinonaktifkan"

msgid "Fixed tries"
msgstr "Jumlah percobaan tetap"

msgid "Infinite"
msgstr "Tidak terbatas"

msgid "Maximum face tries"
msgstr "Percobaan wajah maksimum"

msgid "Face authentication for unlocking this session. This does not affect the login screen. Settings are stored in this extension's configuration."
msgstr "Autentikasi wajah untuk membuka kunci sesi ini. Ini tidak memengaruhi layar login. Pengaturan disimpan dalam konfigurasi ekstensi ini."

msgid "Cinnamon extension for Gaze face authentication and PolKit confirmation"
msgstr "Ekstensi Cinnamon untuk autentikasi wajah Gaze dan konfirmasi PolKit"

msgid "Face not recognized. Please enter your password."
msgstr "Wajah tidak dikenali. Masukkan kata sandi Anda."

msgid "Face not detected. Please enter your password."
msgstr "Wajah tidak terdeteksi. Masukkan kata sandi Anda."

msgid "Too dark for face authentication. Please enter your password."
msgstr "Terlalu gelap untuk autentikasi wajah. Masukkan kata sandi Anda."

msgid "Face authentication timed out. Please enter your password."
msgstr "Waktu autentikasi wajah habis. Masukkan kata sandi Anda."

msgid "Face authentication unavailable. Please enter your password."
msgstr "Autentikasi wajah tidak tersedia. Masukkan kata sandi Anda."

msgid "Changing Gaze's settings or faces needs your password."
msgstr "Mengubah pengaturan atau wajah Gaze memerlukan kata sandi Anda."

msgid "Sorry, face authentication did not work. Please try again."
msgstr "Maaf, autentikasi wajah tidak berhasil. Silakan coba lagi."

msgid "You reached the maximum face authentication attempts, please try another method"
msgstr "Anda telah mencapai batas maksimum percobaan autentikasi wajah, silakan coba cara lain"

msgid "(or look at the camera)"
msgstr "(atau lihat ke kamera)"

msgid "Password"
msgstr "Kata sandi"

msgid "Face verified. Press Enter or click Authenticate to confirm."
msgstr "Wajah terverifikasi. Tekan Enter atau klik Autentikasikan untuk mengonfirmasi."

msgid "Face authentication failed"
msgstr "Autentikasi wajah gagal"

msgid "Face authentication failed. Please enter your password."
msgstr "Autentikasi wajah gagal. Masukkan kata sandi Anda."

msgid "Confirm Face Unlock"
msgstr "Konfirmasi Buka Kunci Wajah"

msgid "Please look at the camera..."
msgstr "Silakan lihat ke kamera…"

msgid "Need more light..."
msgstr "Perlu lebih banyak cahaya…"

msgid "Face is clipped. Please move back..."
msgstr "Wajah terpotong. Silakan mundur…"

msgid "Please center your face..."
msgstr "Posisikan wajah Anda di tengah…"

msgid "Please come closer..."
msgstr "Silakan mendekat…"

msgid "Please back up..."
msgstr "Silakan mundur…"

msgid "Hold still..."
msgstr "Jangan bergerak…"
